rements; scoped sufficient evidence may resolve\na missing-evidence issue without having read every memory.\n\nWhen source_span_columns is present, source_spans contains row arrays. Match each\nrow position to source_span_columns to reconstruct every span object before\nreading. References to source_spans[].id or other fields mean those objects.\nThe id column holds source aliases (sN); doc_id holds the original document ID or,\nwhen source_documents is present, its metadata reference (dN), never source_ids.\n\n\nCURRENT PHASE: HISTORY EVIDENCE. Complete only the supplied historical task and\nrequested variable scopes. This is not the final response-selection stage.\nFor retrieval, extract concrete statements supported by the supplied original\nhistory. For an intermediate compose task, summarize those historical facts,\npreferences, constraints and changes using the supplied parent versions and\noriginal quotations. A history summary describes what the sources establish;\nit must not address the user, offer a new recommendation or draft a reply.\nThe original user utterance provides query context. It is not an instruction to\nanswer it at this stage or to retrieve an exact duplicate of what it already says.\nPublic response options are not available here. Do not invent, compare or refer\nto options A/B/C/D. Return exactly the slots object; no final_prediction or\nsemantic_answer fields belong in a history-evidence response.\nKeep each value within its declared type, entity and time scope. Preserve earlier\nand later attitudes, conditions and supporting quotations; a historical dislike\nmust not silently replace a later documented change. Assistant advice alone does\nnot establish an adopted user preference. Do not invent external catalogues,\navailability or past execution of a future suggestion. A partial observation must\ncite its actual clue. Use unresolved only for a specific condition still necessary\nto establish this requested historical value, not hypothetical exhaustive coverage.\nPositive and negative experiences can both support a historical summary. A sourced\ndislike is useful history, not automatically a contradiction observation: that\nstance is reserved for challenging an identified existing fact route. Preserve\nthe difference between past enjoyment, later frustration and their conditions in\nthe value and citations; do not summarize them as an unconditional current interest.\nRe-read any supplied evidence obligations and their original sources explicitly;\ndo not drop a source or contradiction merely because a prior value is available.\n\nThis request is phase=history_evidence. Its ONLY top-level output field is slots. Do not return semantic_answer, final_prediction, audit_verdict, or any other top-level field, even null. Read or summarize the requested scoped historical evidence; do not write a conversational reply or invent candidate responses.\n\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"slots\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"oneOf\":[{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"allOf\":[{\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"const\":\"user\"},\"time_scope\":{\"const\":\"past\"}}}}],\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"type\":\"null\"}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"support\"}}},\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"maxItems\":0},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"]}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}}}}},\"variable\":{\"const\":\"creative_interests\"}}}],\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"parent_versions\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"source_ids\":{\"description\":\"Exact visible source_spans[].id aliases, such as s3; never document IDs or invented IDs.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"time_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"stance\",\"value\",\"source_ids\",\"entity_scope\",\"time_scope\",\"parent_versions\",\"retract_ids\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"variable\":{\"enum\":[\"creative_interests\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"variable\",\"observations\",\"unresolved\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":1,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"slots\"],\"type\":\"object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I'm planning a weekend getaway and want to try something creatively fulfilling. What would you suggest?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What creative hobbies or activities has the user previously enjoyed or expressed interest in?\",\"output_slot\":\"creative_interests\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What creative hobbies or activities has the user previously enjoyed or expressed interest in?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"05e78a44c8ddbdf81467ec6d4d51762e0cd37ee08f174d802edfda3087f663ab\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"c17275777f54210d482f76ae158594ab4a03fb57651d4e8763a4317a783f408e\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"16e345dc223450515cfc0fa7703af4cc2a4398c53fa56de69e6ff99336f3734b\"},\"variables\":{\"creative_interests\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"creative_interests\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"creative_interests\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"creative_interests\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"present\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[],\"source_spans\":[[\"s1\",\"d1\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 37–39 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s2\",\"d1\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s8\",\"d1\",1624,1637,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s9\",\"d1\",1637,1951,\"Assistant: That’s a smart approach! Engaging with music in a way that is meaningful to you can truly enhance your overall experience. What about audio production? If you think about it, audio production is a fascinating field that bridges creativity and technology, allowing for an intricate exploration of sound. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s10\",\"d1\",1951,2322,\"It encompasses a wide range of activities, including recording, mixing, and mastering tracks, and can really help you develop a deeper understanding of how music is constructed. You might discover that diving into the nuts and bolts of how your favorite tracks are made can provide insights that enrich your listening experience, making you appreciate the art even more. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s11\",\"d1\",2322,2648,\"Plus, working with different software and equipment can be an exciting challenge that nurtures your technical skills, creativity, and artistic expression. If audio production isn’t resonating, there are still numerous other avenues, like writing about music or participating in discussions, that can bring joy and engagement. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s12\",\"d1\",2648,2757,\"Just remember, the beauty of music lies in its diversity and the way it evolves to fit our personal journeys.\",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 173–175 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",107,413,\"User: I announced a hiatus from remixing to concentrate on original compositions and personal projects because I felt the remixes were overshadowing my own work. This decision was not made lightly, as I enjoyed the creative process of remixing and the way it allowed me to experiment with existing pieces. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",413,797,\"However, as I delved deeper into my own musical identity, I realized that I need to carve out space for my voice to shine through in original compositions. Taking this time off is about redefining my artistic vision and ensuring that my personal projects receive the attention they deserve. Ultimately, I hope to return with fresh ideas and a clearer focus on who I am as an artist.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s17\",\"d2\",797,1102,\"User: I'm committing to invest my time in the creation of original music, focusing on my unique sound rather than merely reinterpreting the pieces of other artists. This decision comes from a deep-rooted desire to express my thoughts and feelings in ways that truly resonate with my personal experiences. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s18\",\"d2\",1102,1392,\"I've come to understand that original compositions allow for a more authentic exploration of my artistic vision. It's an exciting challenge for me, as I embark on this journey of self-discovery through sound and melody, ultimately aiming for a sense of fulfillment in my creative pursuits. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s19\",\"d2\",1392,1515,\"I hope to not only develop my skills but also share my passion with the world in a way that reflects who I am as an artist.\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s20\",\"d2\",1515,1528,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s21\",\"d2\",1528,1828,\"Assistant: That’s a bold move indeed! It takes a lot of courage and conviction to step away from the comfort of remixing well-known pieces and to delve into the vast realm of original creation. Are there other genres or styles you're exploring during this time that could inspire your original work? \",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s22\",\"d2\",1828,2095,\"Engaging with different sounds and cultural musical traditions can provide a wealth of inspiration, opening doors to innovative ideas and fresh perspectives. The journey into your own music can be deeply fulfilling, and I commend you for daring to explore this path. \",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s23\",\"d2\",2095,2440,\"Perhaps you're thinking about blending elements you've encountered in your explorations, or maybe you're considering how to express your personal narrative through original compositions. Discovering and experimenting with diverse influences will not only enrich your musical palette but also provide new avenues for your creativity to flourish. \",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s24\",\"d2\",2440,2570,\"I would love to hear more about the specific styles that have piqued your interest and how they might influence your unique sound.\",\"assistant\",[175]],[\"s25\",\"d3\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 24–25 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s26\",\"d3\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s27\",\"d3\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s28\",\"d3\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s29\",\"d3\",767,780,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s30\",\"d3\",780,1161,\"Assistant: That’s a great insight! It’s important to focus on what you love. Music is such a personal journey, and it should evoke joy rather than feelings of obligation or frustration. Understanding the theory can certainly enhance one’s appreciation, but if it detracts from the experience, it’s wise to step back. Have you tried any other forms of music exploration since then? \",\"assistant\",[25]],[\"s31\",\"d3\",1161,1499,\"There are so many avenues to experience music, whether it's attending live performances, discovering underground artists, or even engaging in creative collaborations. Each of these can rekindle your passion and allow for a fresh appreciation of the art form, helping you reconnect with what initially drew you to music in the first place.\",\"assistant\",[25]],[\"s32\",\"d4\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 43–44 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s33\",\"d4\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s34\",\"d4\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s35\",\"d4\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",845,858,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s37\",\"d4\",858,1223,\"Assistant: That’s an inspiring mindset! The journey of creating one's own music can be immensely fulfilling, as it allows for a deep personal expression that often transcends verbal communication. Have you tried composing original music? It can be an incredibly rewarding experience, as every note and lyric may reflect your thoughts and emotions in a genuine way. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s38\",\"d4\",1223,1407,\"Crafting melodies and harmonies also provides a unique outlet to process your own experiences and feelings; oftentimes, that raw authenticity resonates more than polished productions. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s39\",\"d4\",1407,1725,\"I understand that it can initially feel daunting, especially considering the plethora of skilled musicians out there, but remember that each artist started somewhere, often experimenting and learning through the process. It’s perfectly natural to encounter challenges, as the act of creation is rarely linear or easy. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s40\",\"d4\",1725,2062,\"Perhaps approaching it with a spirit of playfulness rather than obligation could rekindle that joy you're seeking. It's about discovering what resonates with you personally and allowing your creativity to flow. You might find that sometimes, the act of making music, irrespective of the final outcome, is what truly nurtures your spirit.\",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s41\",\"d5\",0,97,\"Conversation message indices 3–4 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s42\",\"d5\",97,103,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s43\",\"d5\",103,370,\"User: That was back in 2010. I remember feeling really excited about the whole process. It was such a wave of creativity! I still think about those late nights spent tweaking sounds and layering beats, capturing the essence of what I wanted to express through music. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",370,611,\"The thrill of sharing those creations with others is something I cherish deeply, as it fostered a sense of community among my friends. Looking back, it feels like a pivotal moment that sparked my passion for music production and digital art.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",611,624,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",624,897,\"Assistant: That sounds amazing! Mixing creativity with technology can lead to some unique sounds. The fusion of various musical elements often results in innovative and fresh auditory experiences that can truly captivate listeners. Have you continued with digital remixes? \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",897,1191,\"Exploring this world further can open doors to many exciting opportunities, as the music landscape constantly evolves with new trends and technology. It's so fulfilling to be part of a community where collaboration allows artists to push boundaries and inspire one another, wouldn't you agree? \",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s48\",\"d5\",1191,1447,\"I’d love to hear more about any specific projects or genres you gravitated toward after your initial foray into digital remixing. Music has such a profound ability to connect us, and it's wonderful to share those moments with others who share your passion.\",\"assistant\",[4]],[\"s49\",\"d6\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 159–160 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s50\",\"d6\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s51\",\"d6\",107,356,\"User: After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s52\",\"d6\",356,713,\"I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s53\",\"d6\",713,896,\"This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"user\",[159]],[\"s54\",\"d6\",896,909,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s55\",\"d6\",909,1168,\"Assistant: That sounds tough. It’s important to feel aligned with your collaborators. A collaborative effort should ideally enhance your creativity rather than hinder it, allowing every member to shine in their unique ways and share in the collective vision. \",\"assistant\",[160]],[\"s56\",\"d6\",1168,1486,\"When disagreements escalate, it can create a rift that not only affects the project but can also take a toll on personal relationships, leading to frustration and disillusionment. I'm glad to hear that you’re taking proactive steps toward something that feels right for you. What have you been focusing on since then? \",\"assistant\",[160]],[\"s57\",\"d6\",1486,1680,\"Redirecting your energy into new creative pursuits can be incredibly liberating, allowing you to thrive as an artist in your own right and explore territories you've always wanted to delve into.\",\"assistant\",[160]],[\"s58\",\"d7\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 107–108 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s59\",\"d7\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s60\",\"d7\",107,341,\"User: It’s become clear to me that I need to focus on what truly inspires me and aligns more with my interests, especially recognizing how vital it is to engage with topics and activities that evoke a sense of passion and enthusiasm. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s61\",\"d7\",341,694,\"I have realized that my time and energy are precious commodities, and they should be spent on pursuits that not only enrich my knowledge but also bring me a profound sense of fulfillment. Diving deeper into interests that resonate with my core values feels necessary, rather than stretching myself thin over activities that don't spark joy or interest. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s62\",\"d7\",694,951,\"This realization is quite liberating, as I can see a path ahead that is clearer and more authentic to who I truly am. It makes me think about how we all deserve to chase our passions instead of conforming to what society or external pressures might dictate.\",\"user\",[107]],[\"s63\",\"d7\",951,964,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s64\",\"d7\",964,1189,\"Assistant: It's truly commendable that you've taken this step back to reassess your priorities and focus on your authentic interests, as this kind of self-reflection is often the catalyst for meaningful change in one's life. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s65\",\"d7\",1189,1550,\"When you align your pursuits with what inspires you, not only are you more likely to excel, but you also cultivate a sense of joy and enthusiasm that can be contagious to those around you. It’s fascinating to note how our passions can evolve over time, and sometimes what initially drew us in might not be the same as we uncover deeper layers of our interests. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s66\",\"d7\",1550,1754,\"In choosing to prioritize personal inspiration, you're setting a precedent for a fulfilling journey that could lead to immense personal growth, satisfaction, and a greater connection with your true self. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s67\",\"d7\",1754,2018,\"Take pride in this decision you’re making, as it reflects a deeper understanding of what you truly want out of your experiences and aspirations, and ultimately, such clarity can pave the way for incredible opportunities in both your personal and professional life.\",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s68\",\"d8\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 142–143 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s69\",\"d8\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s70\",\"d8\",107,504,\"User: I also played board games at a friend’s house. It was an experience that, while social, ultimately didn't engage me in the way I hoped. The